    {
      "id": 143918,
      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-07-03T21:27:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The classic combo is for Citizen Dawn to start with Citizens Sweat &amp; Tears, and follow that with a Blinding Blast. &nbsp;Congratulations! &nbsp;Now nobody has any cards in hand, and you'll be losing your card draws every round. &nbsp;Have fun!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For the Chairman, it's hard to match a Contract + Enforcer opening.</p><p>For the Matriarch, a double Cohort opening means you're probably screwed, especially if you're playing Advanced.</p><p>For Baron Blade, Backlash Field is probably the worst card unless you have ongoing destruction on hand.</p><p>Raiding Party is probably the nastiest La Capitan opening.</p><p>It's probably a toss up which of Voss's ships is the worse opener.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That's all I've got for the moment.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:21:25.390Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
